.* INFO: the task menu for the information assistant.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='INFO'.
:IMPORT NAME=SNDMSG PNLGRP=QHMHCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='CMD CALL QCMD'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='CMD CALL QSYS/QUIABOUT'.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=INFO HELP=HLPINFO KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Information Assistant Options
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU SUPPORT' HELP='INFO/OPT1'.Where do I look for information?
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?SNDMSG TOUSR(QSYSOPR)' HELP=SNDMSG.How can I comment on information?
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPINFO.Information Assistant Options - Help
:P.Pointers to the system's own documentation and a way to send a comment
on it.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter. F9 opens a command line, F3
leaves the menu and F12 returns to the one before it. F14 shows About
QS/400: the release, the build and the machine this system runs on.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for where the cursor is.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F9=Command line
:PD.Shows a command line to run a command from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='INFO/OPT1'.Where do I look for information?
:P.Option 1. Shows menu SUPPORT&colon. Where do I look for information?.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
